533618a2-5f80-424d-801f-e9c5c3abfe3a	CSU-2026-001	Completion of Ladies' and Gents' Dormitory	The dormitories are to be constructed in the two campus sites of the Caraga State University. The Butuan campus shall have two 3-storey building for male and female students, respectively. Both dormitories have a total capacity of 550 students. While for the Cabadbaran Campus, a three-storey building with an estimated floor area of 864 sq.m. will cater to both male and female students. It is estimated that 58% of the student population of the Butuan Campus alone is coming from different parts of Caraga Region. Considering the very wide geographical distribution of the CSUans, this project is very vital. Freshmen and transferees, and international students are prioritized to occupy the facility following the University Policy and Guidelines. The facility is composed of bedrooms, dining area, kitchen area, study areas, washing area, comfort rooms, and Wi-Fi lobby/receiving area, dorm manager quarter to cater the needs of the students. Waste disposal facility is made available to segregate waste and to dispose garbage properly. The dormitory is also equipped with water facility to make potable and safe drinking water available at all times.\n\nThe objective of the project is to provide housing and extra-curricular activities for training center to cater freshmen and transferees' students. This facility can help students to access shelter, comfort, good environment conducive for advanced learning and healthy living.\n\nThis is also consistent with the internationalization endeavours of University especially that is was already granted with 3-stars by Quacquarelli Symonds and intend to leverage to the broader pursuit be included in the QS Asia Ranking. To underscore, providing dormitory for international students eases the transition to living and studying abroad, provides an outlet to meet new people and is one less concern for students hunting for housing from another country.	CONSTRUCTION	\N	\N	ONGOING	\N	MAIN	05321ba2-1a87-4041-8089-69e4d9573b00	\N	\N	2026-06-10 10:56:34.893373+08	2026-06-10 10:56:34.893373+08	\N	\N
d309ef6e-a929-48de-876d-e6ee9bd2a448	CSU-2026-002	Construction of College of Forestry and Environmental Sciences Building Complex	The construction of the new CoFES Building Complex includes a multi-storey building, nursery facility, wood shop/wood mill, tree farmer training facility, classroom and office furniture and fixtures, laboratory and wood mill tools and equipment. The proponent or driver of this project is the CSU-COFES. This project\nwill be undertaken together with other proposed horizontal constructions in CSU simultaneously or in phases. The project will affect positively the CoFES students, faculty, and college administration: It will eliminate holding lecture classes under tree shades due to shortage of classrooms; facilities that will help in learning and instruction; and accommodation of other important college ancillary/ies - accreditation, reading room/library; nursery; wood workshop/wood mill, etc.\n	CONSTRUCTION	\N	\N	PROPOSAL	\N	MAIN	05321ba2-1a87-4041-8089-69e4d9573b00	\N	\N	2026-06-10 11:24:52.287128+08	2026-06-10 11:24:52.287128+08	\N	\N
f7794aa6-88fe-49eb-83fc-4ccd556e6c92	CSU-2026-004	Completion of University Gymnasium and Cultural center	The climate-resilient building is designed as a modern industrialized gymnasium that will provide accessibility, comfort, and felicity towards the end-users. The “balangay boat” design at the façade of the building primarily symbolizes the local culture of Caraga. The grandeur roofing forms like the boat as well as the sail. Also, this green building is well-oriented and well-ventilated, thus provide natural lightings during the day and is powered by solar panels as secondary source of power. The landscape is also carefully designed to complement with the vast green environment of Caraga State Unviersity. This will also host some of the key offices of the University.\n\nThe objective of the project is to establish/provide a state of the art gymnasium and cultural facility that is conducive for learning environment, suitable for cultural activities, and a facility that is profitable and self- sustaining.	CONSTRUCTION	\N	\N	PROPOSAL	\N	MAIN	05321ba2-1a87-4041-8089-69e4d9573b00	\N	\N	2026-06-10 11:33:35.309577+08	2026-06-10 11:33:35.309577+08	\N	\N
