4db9ffb1-1b6e-48e2-9034-8f3c426b3ef0	23	f7794aa6-88fe-49eb-83fc-4ccd556e6c92	CSU-2026-004	Completion of University Gymnasium and Cultural center	The climate-resilient building is designed as a modern industrialized gymnasium that will provide accessibility, comfort, and felicity towards the end-users. The “balangay boat” design at the façade of the building primarily symbolizes the local culture of Caraga. The grandeur roofing forms like the boat as well as the sail. Also, this green building is well-oriented and well-ventilated, thus provide natural lightings during the day and is powered by solar panels as secondary source of power. The landscape is also carefully designed to complement with the vast green environment of Caraga State Unviersity. This will also host some of the key offices of the University.\n\nThe objective of the project is to establish/provide a state of the art gymnasium and cultural facility that is conducive for learning environment, suitable for cultural activities, and a facility that is profitable and self- sustaining.	\N	\N	["To establish/provide a state of the art gymnasium and cultural facility that is conducive for learning environment, suitable for cultural activities, and a facility that is profitable and self- sustaining."]	\N	\N	\N	\N	175000000.00	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	4d534c4d-0f5c-4fcc-a44c-b755f8326729	\N	MAIN	PROPOSAL	\N	\N	0.00	0.00	[]	[]	05321ba2-1a87-4041-8089-69e4d9573b00	\N	\N	2026-06-10 11:33:35.327208+08	2026-06-10 11:33:35.327208+08	\N	\N	DRAFT	05321ba2-1a87-4041-8089-69e4d9573b00	2026-06-10 11:33:35.306+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	100.00	100.00	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	[]	[]	{}	[]	[]	[]	\N	\N	Butuan City	Agusan del Norte	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	INTERNAL	\N	[]	{"csu": [], "others": [], "contractor": []}	[]	\N	[]	\N	\N	\N	\N	GAA	\N
